## 5. @PrePersist / @PreUpdate / lifecycle callbacks on Owner

**None.** A repository-wide search for `@PrePersist`, `@PreUpdate`, `@PostPersist`, `@PostLoad`, `@PreRemove`, and `@EntityListeners` across `src/main/java` returned no matches. The Owner entity has no JPA lifecycle callbacks. The normalization that would otherwise be in `@PrePersist` is instead implemented inside the entity setters (`setAddress`, `setEmail`) and the mapper (telephone), so it runs when the mapper populates the entity.

